# A Klingon bird of prey flies an arc around two Borg spheres on layouts/drift.jsonc, one waypoint every three seconds,
# until the spheres destroy it. It dies at speed, so it coasts on while it is dying: the dumps during the dying phase
# show its position still changing, and the shots show the drifting wreck. At --fps 30 the killing hit lands about
# 2.3 s after the last waypoint and the dying phase lasts 5 s; the dumps and shots fall inside it.
# Run it with --layout layouts/drift.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
wait 0.2
select Bop
scroll down 2
wait 0.1
move 2217 -2125
wait 3
move 2125 -2217
wait 3
shot flying
move 2000 -2250
wait 3
move 1875 -2217
scroll up 5
wait 2.8
dump dying-1
expect Bop dying = true
shot dying-1
wait 1.2
dump dying-2
shot dying-2
wait 1.2
dump dying-3
shot dying-3
wait 1.2
shot dying-4
wait 1.3
dump after
expect Bop destroyed = true
